128876 #edb/ref 1074 "The roots are the solutions to the equation\n\n$$\nf(x)=0\n$$\n\nwhich we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf(x) &= 0 \\\\\n2 - 4x &= 0 \\\\\n4x &= 2 \\\\\nx &= \\frac{1}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root\n\n$$\nx=\\dfrac12\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048838 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129650 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129819 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding the Roots of a Function Given Its Graph" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128873 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129106 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "82f5682f-73b8-5c0a-b7d3-3336200843a0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129107 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129649 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129107 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129107 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding the Roots of a Function Given a Table" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129107 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128874 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129107 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "02e29602-b3c0-5ceb-ab65-710c06a08c1d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129108 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129618 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129108 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129619 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129108 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding the Roots of a Function Given a Mapping Diagram" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129108 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128875 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129108 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "578132af-f322-5a68-9771-72e1954622ad" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129109 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048673 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129109 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129815 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129109 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129816 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129109 #edb/ref 1038 #